  "purpose": "Test only whether a genuinely higher-quality Tardis Deribit historical quote/options-chain route can support a future, separately authorized executable VRP MVE. This probe is not a strategy backtest and cannot promote the parent edge.",
  "source": {
    "provider": "Tardis.dev",
